  m_Name: SeaVoidTrawler
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: SeaVoidTrawler
  displayName: Void Trawler
  description: A dock of star-steel whose trawlers draw nets of light through the
    dark tides, out to 24 tiles. Its boats go out to the fish shoals in reach (silver
    glints on the water); the richer they are, the bigger the catch. Shoals fished
    hard thin out and move on, and regrow when left alone.
